{"objective":"Deliver `anvil deploy --target \u003cenv\u003e` MVP (single VPS/bare-metal via SSH) dengan full lifecycle, guard per-env, dan closing 3 HIGH security gaps dari spike — sebagai scope committed untuk execution.","scope":"In-scope (wired ke spike AC):\n- CLI `anvil deploy` (cmd/deploy): flags --target (required), --dry-run (build+verify only), --json (envelope v1), --confirm (staging/prod). Built on internal/artifact (Package, VerifyArtifact) + internal/output (AppError, envelope, PlainStepReporter) — kontrak konsisten spike UX.\n- Config: `server.targets[env]` di anvil.yaml (host,user,sshKeyPath) + DEPLOY_SSH_KEY override (redacted), host-key verification wajib.\n- Transport: SSH scp/rsync atomic tmp+fsync+rename, retry idempotent, p95 \u003c30s target (spike SSH evidence), error classification 6 kinds + Guidance.\n- Server invocation: Negotiate→Install→VerifyStored→Activate via ServerReleaseCoordinator dengan patch RequireVerified di Activate \u0026 Rollback (close HIGH gap). flock OperationLock, optimistic concurrency, no duplicate release (spike race proof).\n- Guard per-env: dev allow, staging --confirm, prod allowlist + confirm + CI-only default, audit binding ke SSH principal.\n- Observability: push % progress + verify step, audit JSON-lines 0600+hash-chain, redaction, `anvil status` queryable, rollback path re-verify.\n- Tests \u0026 quality: unit+integration per AC (spike harness pattern), go vet, eka validate, eka integrity.","outOfScope":"Out-of-scope:\n- Fleet/multi-server orchestrator, blue/green di luar single target.\n- Infra provisioning (VPS create, network, DNS) — assume target reachable via SSH.\n- Registry publish/pull di tengah (post-MVP candidate).\n- Perubahan irreversible lifecycle model — transport adalah trigger, bukan redefinisi lifecycle.\n- `anvil deploy` tanpa verification-before-trust (ditolak)."}